        "created_at": "2016-01-08T13:43:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>A frequent tactic I use on Spite is just to ply as the Wraith and get out the Utility Belt and two Stun Bolts. As I play with H=3, the addition of Smoke Bombs means Spite can't deal any damage at all once I'm the lowest and can redirect (if I'm not already so by the time the Smoke Bombs come out) :D.</p>",
